{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとうございました。皆さん、本当に優しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く感想を生で聞きたいです。そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技についてはもちろん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌について褒めて貰えるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"非常に非常に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番中の楽屋の様子を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご報告します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クールだけど温かい枢先輩は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の缶バッチで遊んできたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の打ち上げは私服に五つも私の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"缶バッチを。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと顔が見えるのもあるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく私を全力でいじってくるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は優しくて面白い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一条先輩に構ってもらったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故か私が仕返しに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"零を吸血してみたり...お前の血良い匂いだなぁ。でも写真じゃ良くわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は1番マイルドで女子な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"架院先輩の寝顔を盗撮したり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝顔は可愛いのでかっこいい写真の方を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自称、腹黒(本当はただのいい子)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅まり亜とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は結構仲良しだったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあぴぴの代わりに本番頑張ってくれたり全員のアンダーをやってくれてた中川ちゃんの支癸先輩のM字前髪が気になったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪って何？真っ白って何？と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枢先輩にひたすら本番前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞きまくったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故か私をめっちゃ敵視してきた藍堂先輩にはノドのケアについて優しく沢山教えてもらってたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様懐かしのプリンシパルdeuxで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世話になったムーンシャドウ先生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿丸さんとまさかの親子になれたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前のアップの時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席で真ん前に居た零をよく見たら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服装双子過ぎるでしょ。真似すんなしっとなって言い合ったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずの仲良しコンビ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヴァンパイアや生徒をやってくれたダンサーのみんなとハンバーガー食べたり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番細くてか弱い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閑様が1番肉好きという衝撃事実。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右上二番目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/01/27/8763679/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むちゃくちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい現場でした(´๑•ω•๑`)☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんながだーいすき♥︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上 第一報告書でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台来れなかったよという方や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"pa